Package: cybroid-edition-security
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://cybroid.com/cybroidos
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: cybroid-plasma (>= @VERSION@), nmap, tshark, wireshark, tcpdump, masscan, gobuster, sqlmap, hydra, john, hashcat, aircrack-ng, sleuthkit, autopsy, yara, binwalk, socat, netcat-openbsd, whois, bind9-dnsutils, podman, distrobox
Description: CybroidOS Security: for analysts and security teams
 Assessment and forensics tools from Debian: Nmap, Wireshark, tcpdump,
 masscan, Gobuster, sqlmap, Hydra, John the Ripper, hashcat, Aircrack-ng, The
 Sleuth Kit and Autopsy, YARA and binwalk. Kali's full toolset (Burp, ZAP,
 Ghidra, radare2, Metasploit) runs in a container: "Kali tools" in Launchpad
 creates it on first use (Distrobox and Podman).
 .
 The same CybroidOS as every edition (look, updates, Hangar), with these
 tools added. An installed CybroidOS becomes this edition by installing this
 package; several editions can be installed together.
